// page-slices.mjs (30 October 2026) : renders a web page exactly as it looks and cuts it into numbered slices of a chosen width (2K = 2048 px), cutting ONLY between blocks (never through a figure, a video, a paragraph or a heading). Floating bars (sticky header, table of contents, buttons) are removed so no bar repeats on every slice.
// FR : rend une page web telle quelle et la découpe en tranches numérotées, coupées entre les blocs.
// Usage: node page-slices.mjs <url> <out-dir> [--width 2048] [--css-width 1024] [--max-height 2600] [--selector article] [--keep-header]
